Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子们 我们出发啦\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Boys, let's do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Gray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你干什么呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Honey, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊 咱们走吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What is this here? Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点宝贝 你们的飞机还有两小时就要起飞了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on, honey. Your flight's in two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴恩县机场开车只要三十六分钟 就算堵车一个小时也够了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Dane County Airport is 36 minutes away, 60 with traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的小屁股挪到车上 要几分钟呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How many minutes to get your little butt in the van?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要几分钟啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How many of those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 床下的小怪物喂了吗 - 喂过了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Feed the monster under your bed? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都要给我打电话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Call me every day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要记得给我发照片 这样我才不会忘了你的样子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}and text me pics so I don't forget what you look like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只离开一个星期而已\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm only gonna be gone a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Zach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又不是上战场 拜托\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're not going off to war here. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快上车\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们晚点见了 - 我爱你\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- I will see you later. - I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Bye, okay? - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐好了吗 宝贝？\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you in, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能理解分别之痛 亲爱的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I know it hurts, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you gonna be okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面的信息都没问题吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Everything right on there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好羡慕你们哦\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm so jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会玩的很开心的 我爱你\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're gonna have so much fun. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I love you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这些交给你哥哥保管 好吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All right, let's give these to your brother, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些你拿着 你可以拿着吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You hold these, please. Can you hold these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 亲爱的 拜托你把这些拿好 - 好的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Honey, I need you to take care of these. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 - 听你妈妈的话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Alright. - Listen to your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好你弟弟 不要不接电话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Take care of your brother. Answer your phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认真跟你说 看到是我的电话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm serious. It's the green button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要按绿色接通键 好吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}When you see my name, push it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万要记住 如果有东西追你们的话 就跑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And remember... something chases you, run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开个玩笑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你真逗 我们该走了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're funny. Okay, let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 孩子们 - 再见\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Bye, guys. - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我已经开始想你们了 - 对\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- I miss you already. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:04:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们家最后一顿早餐就到此为止了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So much for our last family breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要说这种话吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Why do you have to say things like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给你妹妹打电话了吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Did you call your sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接转到语音信箱了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Straight to voice-mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她平时每天要接待两万人呢 对吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She handles 20,000 people a day, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来两个也无妨\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She can handle two more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个岛有多大\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How big is the island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超大\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是它有多重\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But how many pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有什么关系\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚开园的时候 里面只有八个物种\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}When they first opened, they had 8 species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在那里有十四种食草动物和六种食肉动物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Now they have 14 herbivores and 6 carnivores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每周就要消耗五十吨的食物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's 50 tons of food a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:05:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到纳布拉尔 侏罗纪世界之家\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Welcome to Isla Nublar, home of Jurassic World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望各位能跟随我们的队伍 注意安全 玩的愉快\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We hope you have a safe and enjoyable stay with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨去哪了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Where's Aunt Claire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐在列车前方的乘客\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Those of you in the front of the train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以看到我们的园区大门了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}should be able to see our main gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请遵守公园的相关规定\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Please obey all park rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,衣着得体\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Proper attire, including shoes and shirts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得脱下鞋子或衣物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}must be worn at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的阿姨计划在一点和你们见面 他能不能慢点走\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Your aunt arranged to meet you at 1:00. Can he slow down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们阿姨给了你们弄到了VIP通行证\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Your aunt's got you VIP access...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你们使用所有设施都不用排队了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}so you can get in all the rides without waiting in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那咱们走吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟 她说得等等\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Dude, she said we had to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经等不及了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I don't wanna wait anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈尔·奥斯特里是副主席 吉姆·德鲁克发型很丑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hal Osterley, vice president. Jim Drucker, bad hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃里卡·布兰德 需要优待\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Erica Brand, deserves better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈尔 吉姆 埃里卡 哈尔 吉姆 埃里卡\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hal, Jim, Erica. Hal, Jim, Erica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是克莱尔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And I am Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟到三分钟\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Three minutes late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到侏罗纪世界\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Welcome to Jurassic World.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然与去年同期相比 收入不断攀升\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}While year over year, revenue continues to climb...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是营运成本也在不断增加\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}operating costs are higher than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们的股东一直都很有耐心 但老实说...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Our shareholders have been patient but let's be honest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在恐龙对民众的震撼力已经大不如以前了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}no one is impressed by a dinosaur anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二十年前 复活灭绝物种技术奇迹般的出现\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}20 years ago, de-extinction was right up there with magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时至今日 孩子们看剑龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}These days, kids look at a Stegosaurus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和在市动物园看大象一样稀松平常\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}like an elephant from the city zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这并不意味着物种开发已经落伍\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That doesn't mean asset development is falling behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的DNA研究人员每年都会发现新物种\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Our DNA excavators discover new species every year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但游客们想要看到的是体型更大 吼声更响和更多的尖牙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But consumers want them bigger, louder, more teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息是\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The good news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在基因研究上的进步\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Our advances in gene splicing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经开启了一个新的领域\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}have opened up a whole new frontier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去十年中我们从基因学中破解出的信息\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We've learned more from genetics in the past decade...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比一个世纪以来靠挖掘遗骨的收获还要多\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}than a century of digging up bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说的想为景点投资\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}when you say you want to sponsor an attraction...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有什么想法呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}what do you have in mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要眼睛为之一亮的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We want to be thrilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不都是这样吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Don't we all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙 我们的首个转基因物种\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Indominus Rex. Our first genetically modified hybrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是怎么做到让两个不同种类的恐龙... 那个的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How did you get two different kinds of dinosaurs to, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐龙不是繁殖出来的 她是人工设计的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, Indominus wasn't bred. She was designed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成年之后她可以长到十五米高\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She will be 50 feet long when fully grown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比霸王龙还要大\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Bigger than the T. Rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次我们公开一个新的物种 参观人数就会激增\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Every time we've unveiled a new asset, attendance has spiked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全球媒体争相报道\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Global news coverage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名流前来参观\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}celebrity visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让这里成为全世界的焦点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Eyes of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她什么时候能准备好呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}When will she be ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经准备就绪了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She already is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟 慢点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Dude, chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到创新中心\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Welcome to the Innovation Center,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欣赏史前时代与科技的碰撞\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}where technology meets prehistory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三角龙可以与顶端食肉恐龙角牙搏斗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}can go horn-to-tooth with the apex predators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的名字在希腊语意思是三角面\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Literally meaning "three-horned face" in Greek...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三角龙只有霸王龙的一半高\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Triceratops is half as tall as T. Rex{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...相当于一百亿吨炸药的威力\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}...as one-hundred trillion tons of TNT.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的头可以转向背后\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}turn its head back to look over its shoulder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以便可以摆动致命的尾部 击中目标\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}to better aim the swing of its dangerous tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.21,0:09:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胞嘧啶 鸟嘌呤 腺嘌呤 胸腺嘧啶\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Cytosine, guanine, adenine and thymine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有生物都是这四种物质组成的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The same four things in everything that ever lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别乱跑 行吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, don't wander off, all right?{\r}
