Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 我想问的是\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, no, no, how's it doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游客玩得开心吗? 动物们生活得还好吧?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are the guests having fun? Are the animals enjoying life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游客满意度保持在九十分左右\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Well, guest satisfaction is steady in the low 90s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在没有办法测出动物们内心的喜怒哀乐\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We don't have a way to measure the animals' emotional experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以做到 看着他们的眼睛就知道他们快不快乐\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Sure you do. You can see in their eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是吧?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 对\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行吧 现在带我去瞧瞧我的新恐龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay. Now show me my new dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, my!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.45,0:14:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有点紧张啊 克莱尔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You look tense, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是注意力集中 好好开飞机吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Maybe you should just focus on the controls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要活得开心 就得承认一个事实 生活本来就不受控制\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The key to a happy life is to accept you are never actually in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心鸟!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Bird!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该去沙滩上度假\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You should spend a day at the beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晒晒太阳\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Get some sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行 我想说...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Right, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市场部认为 为了节约开支 我们可以...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Marketing thought we could offset some of the costs by...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 别提开支\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Enough about cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·哈蒙德临死前 将这个园子托付给我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}John Hammond entrusted me with his dying wish...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有想过要用这个园子挣钱\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}and not once did he mention profits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"要不计代价" 他经常这么说\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"Spare no expense," he used to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:15:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欣赏他的淡泊 但是要经营好一个主题公园 就必须...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I appreciate that, but the reality of operating a theme park requires...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我们建这个公园的初衷 克莱尔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Don't forget why we built this place, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侏罗纪世界存在的意义 就是为了提醒我们自身有多渺小\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Jurassic World exists to remind us how very small we are. How new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个意义是不能用金钱去衡量的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You can't put a price on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 好好享受 我们的空中飞行\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Now, please, we're flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没事吧?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is he okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧? - 他太小题大做了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Are you okay? - He's just being dramatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还在扩建吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you still building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本打算五月份开放\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We planned to open in May...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但恐龙安保中心建议我们再把围墙盖高一点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}but Asset Containment insisted we build the walls up higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙长得比预期的要大\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's bigger than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好兆头呀\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's a good sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早些时候我们遇到了几次状况\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We hit a few speed bumps early on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙开始预测食物会从哪来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It began to anticipate where the food would come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一名训兽员的胳膊差点没了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}One of the handlers nearly lost an arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他训兽员威胁我说 要是不能保证他们的安全 他们就罢工\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The others threatened to quit if I couldn't guarantee their safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她的智商很高?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She's intelligent then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙中的佼佼者\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}For a dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它曾尝试破窗而入\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It tried to break the glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢她的霸气\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I like her spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是白色的 你从来没告诉我它是白的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's white. You never told me it was white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得它会吓坏小孩子?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Think it will scare the kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅仅吓坏小孩子吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大人也会被吓得做噩梦吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This will give the parents nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好事吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is that good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是太棒了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能看见我们吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Can she see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说它同蛇一样 能感应热辐射\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They say it can sense thermal radiation. Like snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得之前是有两只恐龙呀\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I thought there were two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来是有两头恐龙 以防一头在幼年时夭折\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There was a sibling in case this one didn't survive infancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那另一头在哪?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Where's the sibling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被她吃了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She ate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 围场是安全的咯?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So, the paddock is quite safe, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这有全球最顶尖的结构工程师\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have the best structural engineers in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒙德也是\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, so did Hammond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个人曾是美国海军\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There's an American Navy man here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在在我旗下公司负责的一个研究项目里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Part of a research program one of my companies is running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文 格雷迪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识他\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的动物总想借机逃跑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}His animals often try to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动物们很聪明 他需要更聪明\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They are smart. He has to be smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自认为自己聪明过人\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}He only thinks he's smarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你把他带到这来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I want you to bring him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他监视围场\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let him inspect the paddock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他能发现我们未能察觉的问题\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Maybe he sees something we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Eyes on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理 注意!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Charlie. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别给我来这套!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Don't give me that shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德塔!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Delta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把嘴闭上!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Lock it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们移动!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And we're moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站好!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.99,0:19:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 做得很棒\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's good. That is damn good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Very good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗 查理 做得好就有肉吃\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}See, Charlie, that's what you get!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾可 接好啦!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Echo, there you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德塔!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Delta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This one's for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站好!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抬头!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Eyes up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于做到了 兄弟\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You finally did it, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚还在想我是不是雇错了人...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I was starting to think I hired the wrong guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 没想到啊 你把它们训练得服服帖帖的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}but, damn, you got them eating out of your palm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天情况还好 有时也不太顺利\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You came on a good day. It's not usually a happy ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们迟迟不交报告的原因吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is that why you're not sending in your reports?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们太忙了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We've been busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是有时间提取工资啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Not too busy to cash your paychecks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么吩咐 兄弟?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What do you need, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来场现场试验\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}A field test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我刚刚看见它们可以听从你的指令\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey. I've just seen they can respond to commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以让它们实际运作 重振公园\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We need to take the research and get it on its feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是野生动物 霍斯金斯 相信我 你不会想把她们放出去的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}These are wild animals, Hoskins. Trust me, you don't want them in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚看见了纽带\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I just saw a bond. A real bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,建立在人与野兽之间真正的纽带\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Between man and beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你挡我路了 - 拜托 我们是一样的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- You're in my way. - Come on. We're the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是雇佣兵\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We're dogs of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道 军方需要减少人员伤亡\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We know that the military needs to reduce casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些人认为 机器人是未来参战的主力军\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Some people think that robots are the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 大自然早在7500万年前 就赐予我们最高效的杀人机器\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look, nature gave us the most effective killing machines 75 million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们可以对它们发号施令\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And now we know they can take orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于有了进展 然而他第一件事就说\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We finally make progress and that's the first thing he says?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用来当武器?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Make a weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.67,0:21:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 先生们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on, gents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在时机成熟\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's grown-up time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无人机没法侦查隧道和洞穴 而且还会被黑客攻击\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Drones can't search tunnels and caves. And they're hackable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦发生战争 再酷炫的科技都会黯然失色\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The minute a real war breaks out, all that fancy tech is gonna go dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那些高科技 不会因为人类忘记喂饱它而吃掉人类\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But that tech's not gonna eat them if they forget to feed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这些动物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look at these creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们细胞里有百万年来的本能\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They've got millions of years of instinct in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们可以设定这些本能\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}their cells, instinct that we can program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的忠诚是钱买不来的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Their loyalty cannot be bought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些动物会直接冲向敌军 把他们吃掉...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}These guys are gonna run straight into the enemy's teeth and eat them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连皮带肉\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}belt buckle and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果哪天它们想掌权了呢?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What if they decide they wanna be in control?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就告诉它们谁是老大 杀了不服从命令的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Then we remind them who is. We terminate the rogues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只留下忠诚的血统\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Promote only loyal bloodlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么? 有什么好笑的?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What? What's so funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这 除了了解你想了解的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You come here and you don't learn anything about these animal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于这些动物 你一无所知\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}except what you want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你创造了它们 就觉得占有了它们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You made them and now you think you own them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们本来就属于我们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We do own them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灭绝的动物没有权利可言\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Extinct animals have no rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们现在不算是灭绝了 霍斯金斯\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're not extinct anymore, Hoskins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对 我们现在坐在金矿上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Exactly. We're sitting on a goldmine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛莎尼却只想把它打造成一个儿童动物园\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And Masrani is using it to stock a petting zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是想提醒我们人类有多渺小 并不想制造武器\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}He just wants to teach people some humility. He doesn't make weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得世界财富排名第八的人\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You think that the 8th richest man in the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只经营石油 电信和亲子公园吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}is only into oil, telecom and family fun parks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他经营范围很广 他都不知道他在经营着什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}He's so diversified, he doesn't even know what he owns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国际遗传科技公司什么时候开始这样宣传自己了?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How long has INGEN been practicing this pitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自我们把你从海军挖过来那天起 你就知道终极游戏是什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Since the day we hired you out of the Navy. You knew the end game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些动物能代替成千上万的士兵\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}These animals can replace thousands of boots on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想有多少生命可以被拯救啊?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How many lives would that save?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争是自然界的一部分\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}War is part of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看吧 欧文 丛林里所有的生物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look around, Owen. Every living thing in this jungle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在想办法吃掉对方\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}is trying to murder the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是大自然母亲对动物们的考验\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Mother Nature's way of testing her creations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:22:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是优胜劣汰的筛选\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Refining the pecking order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争是种搏杀 而搏杀成就伟业\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}War is a struggle. Struggle breeds greatness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:22:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有战争...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Without that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能呆在像这样的地方 七块钱就买个汽水\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}we end up with places like this, charge seven bucks a soda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.56,0:23:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己知道你在说什么吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Do you hear yourself when you talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管有没有你们 这都已成定局\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is gonna happen. With or without you boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前进的一方总是获胜 小子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Progress always wins, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许前进的一方该输一次了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Maybe progress should lose for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪逃跑了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Pig loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪逃跑了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Pig loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文 不\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 别开枪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.33,0:23:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 别开枪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold your fire. Do not fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是击伤了它们 它们就再也不会信任我了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Put 12 amps in these animals, they're never gonna trust me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.39,0:24:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝 站住\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blue, stand down.{\r}
