Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.34,0:24:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那别动\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Stay right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门关上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Close the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我没事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Just trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.60,0:24:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门关上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Close the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.01,0:24:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该让它们吃了这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.93,0:24:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.73,0:24:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个新来的 对吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're the new guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.74,0:25:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道为什么有职位空缺了吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You ever wonder why there was a job opening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.90,0:25:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远也不要背对着笼子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Don't ever turn your back to the cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举我起来 我看不到了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Lift me up. I can't see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你爸爸 你也不是五岁小孩\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm not Dad. And you're not five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:26:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仍然可以骑三角龙呢 我才1米2\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I can still ride the Triceratops. I'm 47-and-a-half inches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是给小小孩儿玩的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This place is for little kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 想去坐旋转恐龙蛋吗 - 不想\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Wanna go on the spinning dinosaur eggs? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.93,0:26:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的腰包盖上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Cover up your dork pouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.67,0:26:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的婚礼\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's my wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 亚历克才不会有什么单身派对呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, Alec's not having a bachelor party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.11,0:26:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他朋友都是些狐朋狗友\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Because all his friends are animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散行动\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Scatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 走 快走 走 走\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- What? - Go. Run. Go! Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一场霸王龙喂食表演将于10分钟后开始\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The next T. Rex feeding will begin in 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.86,0:26:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 霸王龙 快走 我的天 - 好好\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- T. Rex! Come on, man! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.06,0:26:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家长们请注意 这场表演可能会引起小孩子的不适\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Parents be aware, this show may be disturbing for smaller children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.78,0:27:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 妈妈\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚下飞机的时候就该给我打电话的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You were supposed to call me when you landed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.72,0:27:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩得开心吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you having fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.09,0:27:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还行吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.15,0:27:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨给了我们通行证 我们就不用排队了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Aunt Claire gave us passes so we don't have to wait in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 她没跟你们在一起吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Wait, she's not with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.16,0:27:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 卡伦\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, Karen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.16,0:27:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔 最近如何啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hi, Claire. How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.94,0:27:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都还好 孩子们玩的很开心\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, everything's great. The boys are having fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.86,0:27:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都...嗯 大家都很好\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Everyone's... Yeah, everyone's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.43,0:27:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 因为我刚刚跟扎克通过话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Really? Because I just hung up with Zach and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.43,0:27:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你甚至都不在身边\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}he said that you weren't even with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.25,0:27:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 听着 今天对我来说是很糟的一天\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, look. Today turned out to be a really bad day for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有人在照料 我的助理跟他们在一起\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're in great hands. They're with my assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是英国人 天生就是做保姆的料\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She's British, so, like, they invented nannies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.97,0:27:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你是哭了吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Wait, are you crying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这应该是个属于家庭的周末 克莱尔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This was supposed to be a family weekend, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.43,0:27:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都几年没见过他们了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You haven't seen the boys in forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.36,0:28:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我知道扎克私底下是怎么对格雷的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And I know how Zach will treat Gray if they're by themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.65,0:28:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会欺负他的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And he can just be so mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.25,0:28:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我很抱歉\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.11,0:28:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天 我会花一整天的时间跟他们在一起\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Tomorrow, I'm gonna spend the entire day with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.55,0:28:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会请个假 然后不离开他们半步 我保证\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm going to take off work and I will not leave their side. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明日的承诺远不及今日的行动\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Well, a promise tomorrow is worth a lot less than trying today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.15,0:28:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是在说 老妈说过的话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're using Mom's lines now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.23,0:28:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天呐 我在用老妈说过的话\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, my God. I am using Mom's lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.38,0:28:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 但是我不得不说这很管用\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm sorry, but you know I have to tell you they work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.36,0:28:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有孩子 你就知道了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You'll see when you have kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.98,0:28:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 "如果"\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, "if."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.26,0:28:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"会有的" 都是值得的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"When." It's worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 老妈\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Bye, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.69,0:28:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.67,0:28:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在想要干嘛\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What do they want now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.50,0:28:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷迪先生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Mr. Grady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想请你来帮忙看些东西\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I need you to come take a look at something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.68,0:29:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要叫我格雷迪先生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Why are you calling me Mr. Grady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.09,0:29:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.23,0:29:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果你不忙的话 - 我现在很忙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- If you're not too busy. - I'm pretty busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.74,0:29:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个新景点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have an attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.47,0:29:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次我们见面时你可不是这么叫的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's not what you said the last time I saw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.31,0:29:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在在说的是恐龙 格雷迪先生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm talking about the dinosaurs, Mr. Grady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫欧文\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.85,0:29:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们创造了...一个新的品种\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}A new species we've... made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来就是要说 你们创造了新的恐龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You just went and made a new dinosaur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这差不多就是我们的工作\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, it's kind of what we do here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.67,0:29:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展览将在三周后开放给公众\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The exhibit opens to the public in three weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.11,0:29:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛莎尼先生想让我请教一下你的意见\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Mr. Masrani wanted me to consult with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想在这请教还是在...我的房间里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You wanna consult here or... in my bungalow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.34,0:29:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好笑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.41,0:29:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得满好笑的啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}A little funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.71,0:29:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想让你评估一下围场有什么弱点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We'd like you to evaluate the paddock for vulnerabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.73,0:29:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么找我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜玛莎尼在想 既然你能控制那些迅猛龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I guess Mr. Masrani thinks, since you're able to control the Raptors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.05,0:29:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你张口闭口都是控制\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's all about control with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.63,0:30:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不控制迅猛龙 这是一种情感关系\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I don't control the Raptors. It's a relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.37,0:30:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基于相互尊重\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's based on mutual respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是为何你和我不会有第二次约会\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's why you and I never had a second date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.25,0:30:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 我从未想过有第二次约会\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Excuse me? I never wanted a second date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.11,0:30:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁晚上出门还专门打印个行程表\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Who prints out an itinerary for a night out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是个很有条理的人\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm an organized person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪种食谱 会禁止喝龙舌兰\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What kind of a diet doesn't allow tequila?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 是所有的食谱\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All of them, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.31,0:30:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的男人约会时还穿着沙滩短裤\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And what kind of a man shows up to a date in board shorts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.65,0:30:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是中美洲 很热\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's Central America. It's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.38,0:30:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 好 我们可不可以专注在 恐龙资产上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, okay. Can we just focus on the asset, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.05,0:30:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙资产？\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The asset?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.45,0:30:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 我懂了 你是这里的负责人\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look, I get it. You're in charge out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.42,0:30:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须做很多艰难的决定\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You gotta make a lot of tough decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.89,0:30:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那些动物视为数据 可能会容易点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's probably easier to pretend these animals are just numbers on a spreadsheet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.59,0:30:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是它们不是数字 它们是活着的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But they're not. They're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.78,0:30:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚它们是活着的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm fully aware they're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.39,0:30:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许从一个试管里创造了它们 但是它们不知道那些\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You might have made them in a test tube, but they don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.29,0:30:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们只会想 我要吃东西\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're thinking, "I gotta eat."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.25,0:30:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要捕猎 我要...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"I gotta hunt. I gotta..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.81,0:30:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这其中至少有一样你能体会 对吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You can relate to at least one of those things. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在车里等你\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'll be in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.24,0:31:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许该换件衬衫 它们对味道相当敏感\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You might want to change your shirt. They're very sensitive to smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.09,0:31:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沧龙被认为在水面附近捕猎\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Mosasaurus was thought to have hunted near the surface of the water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在那里猎捕一切它能咬得动的东西\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}where it preyed on anything it could sink its teeth into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括海龟 大鱼 甚至小沧龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Including turtles, large fish, even smaller Mosasaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 伙计们 让我们看看她今天吃过了饭之后是不是还是很饿\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, folks, let's see if she's still hungry after already eating today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有点害羞 所以表现得友善点 当她出来时给她的掌声\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She's a little shy, so be nice and give her a hand when she comes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Zach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是沧龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Mosasaurus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我的天 太酷了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, my God! That was awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 我们将让你们更近距离的欣赏沧龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold on tight. We're gonna give you an even closer look at our Mosasaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.19,0:32:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有88颗牙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It had 88 teeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.24,0:32:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 想不想看更酷的东西 - 想\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Wanna see something else cool? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经开放预订数月了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We've been pre-booking tickets for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每过几年公园就需要一个新景点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The park needs a new attraction every few years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.97,0:32:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来重新引起公众的兴趣\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}in order to reinvigorate the public's interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.18,0:32:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点像太空项目\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Kind of like the space program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.83,0:32:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司认为引用转基因技术 可以提高惊喜指数\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Corporate felt genetic modification would up the wow factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.82,0:32:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是恐龙 这还不够吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're dinosaurs. Wow enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.86,0:33:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,民调可不这么认为 暴虐霸王龙让我们再次成为焦点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Not according to our focus groups. The Indominus Rex makes us relevant again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.16,0:33:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐霸王龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Indominus Rex?{\r\fnFZHei-B01S\fs14}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.96,0:33:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要一个 恐怖又好念的名字\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We needed something scary and easy to pronounce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.95,0:33:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四岁小孩是念不出 “远古似鸟龙”的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You should hear a four-year-old try to say "Archaeornithomimus."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不太会念\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You should hear you try to say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西是什么造出来的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So what's this thing made of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.68,0:33:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主基因组是霸王龙 剩下的是机密\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The base genome is a T. Rex. The rest is classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们造了个新恐龙 却不知道她的组成来源是什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You made a new dinosaur but you don't even know what it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.37,0:33:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实验室负责供给我们展品 我们负责向公众展示\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The lab delivers us finished assets, and we show them to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.06,0:33:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能投个肉牛饵吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Can we drop a steer, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.98,0:33:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西这在多久了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How long has the animal been in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.01,0:33:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从出生开始\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All its life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她从没见过墙外的世界\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Never seen anything outside of these walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.62,0:33:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总不能带她去散步吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We can't exactly walk it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.99,0:33:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就用那玩意喂它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And you feed it with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔离环境长大的动物 通常都有缺陷\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Animals raised in isolation aren't always the most functional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.74,0:33:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的迅猛龙也是圈养的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Your Raptors are born in captivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.20,0:33:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们和兄弟姐妹们一起 能学到社交技能\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}With siblings. They learn social skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.98,0:34:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我在她们 一出生就训练她们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And I imprint on them when they're born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.11,0:34:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们彼此信任\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There's trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.39,0:34:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这家伙唯一的互动对象 就是那台起重机\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The only positive relationship this animal has is with that crane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.41,0:34:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少她知道那意味着食物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}At least she knows that means food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.27,0:34:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你认为她需要个朋友\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So, she needs a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.04,0:34:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要给她安排个玩伴吗 诸如此类的东西\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We should schedule play-dates? That sort of thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不是个好主意\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Probably not a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.78,0:34:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她上哪去了 - 会不会在地下室\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Where is it? - Is it in the basement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.27,0:34:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有楼下吗? 或者可能在娱乐室\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is there a downstairs? Maybe it's in the rec room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它刚才还在这 我们刚才也在这\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It was just here. We were just here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.62,0:34:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, shit.{\r}
