Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.75,0:35:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以从控制室追踪它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I can track it from the control room.{\r}
