Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.13,0:35:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我13岁以前从没见过他...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Even though I didn't meet him until I was 13...{\r}
