Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.49,0:36:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这是怎么回事?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Wait, what the hell?{\r}
