Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.46,0:36:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那不可能 我刚还在那\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, that's impossible. I was just there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.81,0:36:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔 我告诉你 它就在笼子里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Claire, I'm telling you, she's in the cage.{\r}
