Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,11号围场 收到吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Paddock 11, do you copy?{\r}
