Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.57,0:39:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人保持冷静\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Everyone remain calm.{\r}
