Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.15,0:39:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 它现在行动非常迅速\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay. It's moving really fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.70,0:39:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是控制室 拉响全景区警报\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is Control. Put out a park-wide alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.74,0:40:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那该死的电话挂上 拜托\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hang up that damn phone, please.{\r}
