Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.30,0:40:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让展品控制部 悄悄的捕获它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let Asset Containment capture it quietly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.08,0:40:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个公园要想能够立足...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The very existence of this park is predicated on our ability...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.95,0:40:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要有应对这种突发事件的能力\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}to handle incidents like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.88,0:40:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个偶然事件 好吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It was an eventuality, okay?{\r}
