Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.31,0:40:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个围场离最近的景区有4英里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That paddock is 4 miles from the closest attraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.61,0:40:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展品控制部可以掌控局面 没有人会...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}ACU can handle this. No one else is gonna get...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.27,0:40:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被吃掉?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Eaten?{\r}
