Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.60,0:40:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果饿起来了可以跑50\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}50 when they're hungry.{\r}
