Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.10,0:40:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.21,0:40:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.13,0:40:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被吓到了 它吓到我了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That got me. It got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.03,0:41:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在想什么? 想带一个回家吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What do you think? Want to take one home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.77,0:41:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 不要开玩笑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, don't joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我是你这么大的时候...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}When I was your age...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.37,0:41:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救了一只小狼崽\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I rescued a wolf pup.{\r}
