Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.64,0:41:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会它就睡在我床边\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It used to sleep by my bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.33,0:41:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Watch over me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.91,0:41:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆 她拿着一把牛排刀向我冲过来时 那狼崽子把她的胳膊咬下一大块\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}My wife, she came at me with a steak knife. It took a chunk out of her arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.16,0:41:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有把那狼崽杀了吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Did you put him down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.22,0:41:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hell, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.39,0:41:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间有一种无法动摇的羁绊 你懂吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We had an unshakeable bond, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.81,0:41:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你和...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Just like you and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫什么名字?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What's his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.91,0:41:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德塔 而且它是女生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Delta. And she's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.84,0:41:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能...?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Can I...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.16,0:41:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.03,0:42:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,19号状况!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Code 19!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.77,0:42:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是那个新玩意! - 他们说我们已经死了两个人!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- That's the new one! - They said we lost two guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.47,0:42:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 19号状况是什么? - 那是暴虐龙!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- What's a Code 19? - That's Indominus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.97,0:42:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,产品突然逃脱\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Asset out of containment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.98,0:42:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人 他们从不吸取教训\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}These people, they never learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在要从这新产品上获得各种教训了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're gonna learn all kinds of things about their new asset now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.71,0:42:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是我 我们可能有个机会\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, it's me. We might have an opportunity here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.41,0:42:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个来过这里吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You guys been here before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.31,0:42:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果爸妈离婚 我们会不会一个跟着妈一个跟着爸?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}If Mom and Dad get divorced, will one of us be with Mom and the other with Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.93,0:42:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 你为什么这么说?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What? Why would you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.47,0:42:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们会离婚\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Because they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.48,0:42:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们不会… 他们不会离婚的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, they're not getting... They're not getting divorced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.65,0:43:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你跟他们相处的时间不够长 他们一直以来都是那个样子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look, you haven't been around long enough. They've always been that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.95,0:43:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有不同的律师分别给他们发信件\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They get mail from two different lawyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.94,0:43:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那说明不了什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That doesn't mean anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.38,0:43:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上网查了 那些都是离婚律师\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I googled. They're divorce lawyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.89,0:43:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 随便吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All right, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.26,0:43:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 这不重要 好吗? 反正我过两年就要离开家了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You know what? It doesn't matter. Okay? I'm gonna be gone in two years anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.32,0:43:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很多朋友的父母都离异了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All my friends' parents are divorced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.70,0:43:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 别这样\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, knock it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.42,0:43:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哭什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're gonna cry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.18,0:43:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 以后你所有的东西都会有两份\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look, you're gonna get two of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对? 两份生日礼物 两份感恩节礼物 两份...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Right? Two birthdays, two Thanksgivings. Two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.10,0:43:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想什么都有两份\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I don't want two of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.79,0:43:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 但这不是你能决定的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, well, it's not up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.89,0:43:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你必须要学着长大\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There's a point you have to grow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.92,0:44:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要看你的证件\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I need to see a badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.23,0:44:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 先生 请出示通行证 - 那里究竟发生了什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Sir, sir. I need to see a badge. - What the hell happened out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.49,0:44:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.00,0:44:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,围墙里到处都是热感应摄像头\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There are thermal cameras all over that paddock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.08,0:44:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不可能就这么消失了!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She did not just disappear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.29,0:44:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才肯定是有什么地方出了点技术故障\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It must have been some kind of a technical malfunction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才没看吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Were you not watching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.25,0:44:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它故意留下爪痕 是为了分散我们的注意力 它想让我们以为它逃跑了!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She marked up that wall as a distraction. She wanted us to think she escaped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.98,0:44:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我们讨论的只是个动物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hold on. We are talking about an animal here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个极高智商的动物 - 据离目标400米\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- A highly intelligent animal. - 400 meters to the beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.65,0:44:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然只带非致命性武器去追踪它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're going after her with non-lethals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.63,0:45:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个产品我们投资了2600百万美元 我们可不想就这么杀了它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have $26 million invested in that asset. We can't just kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.77,0:45:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人会死的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Those men are gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.18,0:45:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据离目标300米\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}300 meters to the beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.57,0:45:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 立即取消行动 - 他们已经到了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Call this mission off right now. - They're right on top of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.95,0:45:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 叫他们回来 现在！ - 现在不由你发号施令!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Call it off right now. - You are not in control here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血都还没凝固\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blood's not clotted yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它就在附近\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.29,0:45:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.17,0:45:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是它体内的追踪器 被它挖出来了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's her tracking implant. She clawed it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.93,0:45:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它怎么会知道这么做?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How would it know to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.99,0:45:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它记得这个东西当初植入的位置\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She remembered where they put it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.56,0:46:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会使用保护色伪装！\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It can camouflage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.82,0:47:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疏散这个岛\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Evacuate the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.99,0:47:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那乐园就别想再开了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We'd never reopen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.51,0:47:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们造了一个基因杂交的动物 在笼子里养大它\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You made a genetic hybrid, raised it in captivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.15,0:47:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她第一次看到了外面的世界\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She is seeing all of this for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.82,0:47:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它甚至连自己是什么都不知道\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She does not even know what she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会把周围所有能动的物体都杀掉\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She will kill everything that moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.34,0:47:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这个动物 在思考自己是个什么东西?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Do you think the animal is contemplating its own existence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.61,0:47:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在确认自己在食物链中的位置...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She is learning where she fits in the food chain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.60,0:47:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你肯定不希望它会搞明白的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}and I'm not sure you want her to figure that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.61,0:47:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 展品控制部在紧急情况下可以使用真枪实弹\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Now, Asset Containment can use live ammunition in an emergency situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.56,0:48:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以在直升机上 安装M134机枪干掉那玩意！\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You have an M134 in your armory. Put it on a chopper and smoke this thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.77,0:48:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里有很多家庭 我不会让这里变成战场！\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have families here. I'm not gonna turn this place into some kind of a war zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.86,0:48:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里已经是了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.10,0:48:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷迪先生 如果你不想帮忙 那你就没必要留在这了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Mr. Grady, if you're not gonna help, there's no reason for you to be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你们实验室的那帮人好好谈一谈\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I would have a word with your people in the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.59,0:48:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面那玩意... 绝对不是恐龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That thing out there... that's no dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.23,0:48:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我下令 将度假区以北的所有展厅全部关掉\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I'm going to close everything north of the resort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.26,0:48:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入一级戒备 这不是演习 所有人都回到室内\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is a Phase One, real world. Bring everyone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.01,0:48:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入一级戒备 这不是演习 重复 进入一级戒备\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is a Phase One, real world. I repeat, this is a Phase One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.05,0:48:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让所有人都回到室内\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Bring everyone back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.59,0:49:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些软组织之所以能够保存下来 是因为恐龙血液里面的铁元素...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The soft tissue is preserved because the iron in the dinosaur's blood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.17,0:49:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会产生自由基 并且都具有高反应性\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}generates free radicals, and those are highly reactive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.57,0:49:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋白质和细胞膜混合在了一起...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The proteins and the cell membranes get all mixed up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,形成了天然的防腐剂\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}and act as a natural preservative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.73,0:49:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样DNA遗传物质即便是经过千年也可以保存下来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}DNA can survive for millennia that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.29,0:49:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便是那些琥珀的矿源枯竭了 他们还会有骨头...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Even if the amber mines dry up, they'll still have bones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.11,0:49:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.44,0:49:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你光是盯着她们看 能又有什么用？\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What do you think's gonna happen from you just staring at them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.29,0:49:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你喔 老弟 - 不客气\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Thanks, man. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.45,0:49:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旅途愉快\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Enjoy the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孕妇及行动不便者...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Pregnant women and those who suffer from motion sickness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.16,0:49:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在开始这段旅途前请先咨询医生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}should consult with a doctor before riding this ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.90,0:49:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旅途愉快\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Enjoy the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.64,0:49:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.90,0:50:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.19,0:50:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 大家伙 这里关闭了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Sorry, folks. The ride is closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.18,0:50:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请各位离开到单轨列车上…\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Everyone needs to proceed to the monorail and exit towards the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.11,0:50:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我只是在做我的工作\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on, guys, I just work here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.43,0:50:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于一些技术原因 所有设施均已关闭\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Due to technical difficulties, all our exhibits are now closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.44,0:50:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我没有权利去透露产品的基因结构\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You know that I'm not at liberty to reveal the asset's genetic makeup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.85,0:50:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转基因动物是无法预测的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Modified animals are known to be unpredictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.46,0:50:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它杀人了 亨利\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's killed people, Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.27,0:50:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真不幸\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.97,0:50:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让一只恐龙能够利用保护色伪装有什么用?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What purpose could we have for a dinosaur that can camouflage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.13,0:50:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墨鱼基因的注入 能帮助她承受加速成长的环境\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Cuttlefish genes were added to help her withstand an accelerated growth rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.94,0:50:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墨鱼的色素细胞可以改变肤色\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Cuttlefish have chromatophores that allow the skin to change color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.91,0:50:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她躲开了热感应器\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It hid from thermal technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.22,0:51:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.36,0:51:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么做到的?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How is that possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.14,0:51:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树蛙可以调节它们的红外线输出量\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Tree frogs can modulate their infrared output.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.90,0:51:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给予她从树蛙中提取的DNA 以适应热带气候\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We used strands from their DNA to adapt her to a tropical climate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.04,0:51:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但万万没想到...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But I never imagined...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.04,0:51:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁授权给你这么做的?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Who authorized you to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.76,0:51:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.01,0:51:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"更大"\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"Bigger."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.53,0:51:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"更可怕"\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"Scarier."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.18,0:51:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"更酷" 我记得你在备忘录上是这么写的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}"Cooler" I believe is the word that you used in your memo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.72,0:51:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能要求造出一个 拥有超凡猎食者的外形特征...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You cannot have an animal with exaggerated predator features...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.42,0:51:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不具备猎食者相应行为的东西\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Without the corresponding behavioral traits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.21,0:51:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在所做的研究...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What you're doing here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.65,0:51:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及你完成的成果...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What you have done...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.83,0:51:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,董事会会关闭这个公园 解除你的工作 以及你迄今为止所做的一切\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Board will shut down this park, seize your work, everything you've built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.13,0:51:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒙德这次不会替你求情了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And Hammond won't be there to protect you this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.00,0:51:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能有今天这些都是因为我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All of this exists because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.56,0:51:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我不做 总有人会做的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}If I don't innovate, somebody else will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.62,0:52:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻中止所有实验活动\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You are to cease all activities here immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.41,0:52:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话说的就好像我们在做什么疯狂的实验\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You are acting like we are engaged in some kind of mad science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.17,0:52:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们从一开始就是这么做的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But we are doing what we have done from the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.02,0:52:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,侏罗纪世界的一切都是有悖于自然的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Nothing in Jurassic World is natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.39,0:52:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们用其他物种的DNA来弥补恐龙基因上的缺陷\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have always filled gaps in the genome with the DNA of other animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.36,0:52:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且 如果使用纯正的原始基因 结果会大相径庭\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And, if their genetic code was pure, many of them would look quite different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.62,0:52:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你追求的不是真实 你要的只是更多的尖牙利爪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But you didn't ask for reality. You asked for more teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.21,0:52:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可没说要一只怪物! - "怪物" 是个相对的概念\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- I never asked for a monster! - "Monster" is a relative term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对金丝雀而言 猫就是怪物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}To a canary, a cat is a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.82,0:52:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是习惯了当猫罢了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We're just used to being the cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.63,0:52:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我是吉米·法伦\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, there. I'm Jimmy Fallon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.43,0:52:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎乘坐陀螺球 一个利用科学造就可能的神奇机器\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Welcome aboard the Gyrosphere, an amazing machine made possible by science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.49,0:52:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的安全是我们最关心的事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Your safety is our main concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.16,0:52:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特制的透明屏障系统会保护你们...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Which is why you're behind our invisible barrier system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.40,0:52:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免受双脊龙毒液的侵蚀\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Which protects you from things like Dilophosaurus venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.21,0:52:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一滴就会让你瘫痪 所以要特别小心\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}One drop of this can paralyze you, so watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.06,0:52:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗? 真的?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is this real? It is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.06,0:53:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了增强保护 每辆车由氧氮化铝玻璃包围\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And for added protection, each vehicle is surrounded by aluminum oxynitride glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分坚固 它可以阻挡50口径的子弹\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So tough, it can stop a .50-caliber bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.23,0:53:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回转技术会让您随时保持与地面垂直状态\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}The Gyroscopic technology will keep you upright at all times...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.41,0:53:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们在哪儿?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.59,0:53:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以请不要担心\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}So you've got nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.03,0:53:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.79,0:53:55.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于出现技术故障 所有设施现已关闭\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Due to technical difficulties all our exhibits are now closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.02,0:53:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请所有游客撤离游乐设施并返回酒店\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Please disembark all rides and return to the resort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.21,0:54:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我们能在外面多待一会儿\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on, we can stay out a couple more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.54,0:54:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们说要关闭了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But they said it was closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.57,0:54:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱尔阿姨不是给了我们贵宾腕带吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Aunt Claire gave us special wristbands, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.86,0:54:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是贵宾 老弟\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We're VIP, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.12,0:54:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 会很有趣的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on. It'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.34,0:54:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂? - 扎拉\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Hello? - Zara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.57,0:54:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你立刻把孩子们带回酒店\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I need you to bring the boys back to the hotel right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.76,0:54:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道... 我到处找他们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I don't know... I've been looking everywhere for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.40,0:54:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说慢点 我听不清楚\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Slow down. I can't hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.04,0:54:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克和格雷 他们跑了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Zach and Gray, they've run off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.38,0:54:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么了?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.28,0:55:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿克莱尔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.69,0:55:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克 感谢上帝 格雷和你在一起吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Zach, thank God. Is Gray with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.28,0:55:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听不清你说啥 我们在仓鼠球里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I can't really hear you. We're in the hamster ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.94,0:55:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 扎克 听我说\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay. Zach, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.85,0:55:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你现在...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I need you to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.07,0:55:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.92,0:55:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂? - 扎克?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Hello? - Zach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.00,0:55:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有没有陀螺球留在溪谷里没回来?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are there any Gyrospheres left in the Valley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.94,0:55:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 都回来了 是我清点的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, they're all accounted for. It's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.68,0:55:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一台在外面\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There's one in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.82,0:55:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派救援队带他们回来\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Send a team of rangers, bring them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.90,0:55:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保安队 我们需要派搜救队员前往溪谷\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Security, we need a search and rescue in the Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.88,0:55:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要等一会 我们忙不过来了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's gonna be a while. We've got our hands full out here.{\r}
