Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.88,1:05:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那顶多能活两分钟 更何况你还穿着这可笑的鞋子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You'll last two minutes in there. Less, in those ridiculous shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.56,1:06:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What is that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.24,1:06:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是我准备好出发了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It means I'm ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.34,1:06:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.59,1:06:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话先说好了 在这里我说了算\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let's get one thing straight. I'm in charge out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.79,1:06:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说什么你都得照做\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You do everything I say, exactly as I say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么? - 放松就行\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Excuse me? - Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.61,1:06:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当是在森林里漫步一样\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's just like taking a stroll through the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.58,1:06:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六千五百万年前的森林\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}65 million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.35,1:07:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.98,1:08:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.00,1:08:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还带着那些火柴吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You still have those matches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.02,1:08:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.43,1:09:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Gray!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.06,1:09:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1992年吉普牧马人 沙黄色\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}1992 Jeep Wrangler Sahara, Sand Beige.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.55,1:09:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我们修理过外公的老爷车 对吧?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You remember when we fixed up Grandpa's old Malibu, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.76,1:09:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.28,1:10:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西越杀越往南走了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Every time this thing kills, it moves further south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.20,1:10:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直冲着公园而去\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It's headed right for the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.15,1:10:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么会到那儿去\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Why would she come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.72,1:10:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能感应到热辐射\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}She can sense thermal radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.60,1:10:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的应急措施 把所有人都集中到同一个地方\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Our emergency measures just put all the warm bodies in one place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.89,1:10:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生... - 国际遗传科技\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Sir... - INGEN.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.18,1:10:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霍斯金斯\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hoskins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.09,1:10:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.52,1:10:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你也就知道我为什么会来这儿了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Then you know why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.55,1:10:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我研究迅猛龙项目计划已经两年了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I've been working for two years on an application for those Raptors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.52,1:10:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们有能力捕杀那个怪物\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They can hunt and kill that creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.49,1:10:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你的项目是为了测试它们的智商的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But your program was to test their intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.93,1:10:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 确实是这样 而且我们也做到了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, it was. And we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.50,1:10:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个过程中 我们有了新发现\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And in the process, we learned something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.19,1:10:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们能听从指令\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They follow orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.62,1:10:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也看见了 解决你造成的这次危机的人 就站在你眼前\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You see, the solution to your crisis is standing right in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.65,1:10:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把话说清楚\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let me be as clear as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.03,1:10:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会让迅猛龙在这个岛上到处乱跑\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No Velociraptors are going to be set loose on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.04,1:10:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢 该死！\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.19,1:10:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是疯了吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're out of your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.91,1:10:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你打算拿这些人怎么办\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What are you going to do with all these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.32,1:10:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岛上有两万多人 现在你打算怎么办\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You got 20,000 people here. What are you going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.22,1:10:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们无处可逃\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They have no place to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.70,1:11:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意就是个杀人机器\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That thing is a killing machine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.26,1:11:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这机器是不会停下的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}And it will not stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.97,1:11:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.94,1:11:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会亲自审查你的项目计划\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I intend to personally look into your project...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.23,1:11:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以确定它是否符合公司的道德原则\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}to determine its viability within the moral principles of this company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.63,1:11:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 老板说了算\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.77,1:11:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的下一步是什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What's your next move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.08,1:11:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我联系不上你的教练\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Sir, I can't get a hold of your instructor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.03,1:11:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 他大概在忙着疏散游客\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Never mind. He's likely caught up in the evacuation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.52,1:11:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没有其他人 能驾驶直升机吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're sure there's nobody else who can fly a helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.25,1:11:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要其他人\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We don't need anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.82,1:12:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得它在附近吗？\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You think it's out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 它绝对不在附近 好吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I mean, I know for a fact it is definitely not out there, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.91,1:12:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是安全的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We're totally safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.80,1:12:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 拿着这个\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Here, go take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.39,1:12:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比我更强壮\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're stronger than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.28,1:12:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 启动试试\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All right. Turn it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.83,1:12:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}It works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.35,1:12:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你没考到驾照呢\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I thought you failed your driver's test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.09,1:12:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只有路考没过\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, only the driving part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们的吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This one of theirs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.99,1:13:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.07,1:13:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路直通园区\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That road goes straight back to the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.26,1:13:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底怎么把这堆破铜烂铁发动起来的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}How did they even get one of these things started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.45,1:15:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛瑞 我们找到她了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Lowery, we found her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.75,1:15:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陀螺球山谷南边 在旧园区和飞禽馆之间\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}South of the Gyrosphere Valley, between the old park and the Aviary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.09,1:15:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 等会 你们是在跟着暴虐龙吗 - 是的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}- Wait, are you following the dinosaur? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.05,1:15:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让展品控制部过来 这次要用真枪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Get ACU out here. Real guns this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.63,1:15:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,展品控制部的人过去了 他们开着直升机\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}ACU is airborne. They took the helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.67,1:15:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁在驾驶\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Who's flying it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.48,1:15:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以前是在军队服役过吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Did you boys serve in the Armed Forces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.67,1:15:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在阿富汗 先生\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Afghanistan, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.54,1:15:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的将军和你们一起上过战场吗\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Did your general ever fly into battle with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.20,1:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 没事\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Got it! Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.06,1:15:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已发现目标 在飞禽馆南边\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have eyes on the target, south of the Aviary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.80,1:15:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备作战\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Proceed and engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.18,1:15:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 打起精神来 小伙子们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Come on! Look alive, boys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.97,1:15:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Look alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.29,1:16:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十点钟方向 就在鸟笼边上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}10 o'clock! By the birdcage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, no, no! No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.88,1:16:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来简直就像狐狸进了鸡舍\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Looks like the fox got in the henhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.88,1:16:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉升 拉升 上去 快上去\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Pull up! Pull up! Up, up, up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.12,1:17:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞禽馆出现缺口\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We have a breach in the Aviary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.37,1:17:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树林 快到树林里去 快 快走\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Trees, the trees! Go! Go!{\r}
