Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.03,1:26:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都会离开这座岛\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Everybody's gonna get off this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.82,1:27:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天你将看到新闻报导 你是怎么拯救生命的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're gonna watch a news story tomorrow about how you all saved lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.83,1:27:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 比这还好...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, no, no, better yet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.09,1:27:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是 你的动物是怎么拯救这些生命的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}how your animals saved lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.89,1:27:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们从来没被放出过笼子 这太疯狂了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They've never been out of containment. It's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.84,1:27:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行动吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Let's move it out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.62,1:27:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已成定局了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.08,1:27:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有你们都一样\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}With or without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.10,1:27:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道她在第五区\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We know that she is in sector five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.46,1:27:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们称作捉迷藏的游戏  气味训练\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This is a game we call hide-and-seek. It's a scent drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.45,1:27:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经和这些动物操练过几千次了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We've done it about a thousand times with these animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.64,1:27:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到它们锁定目标 就不会忘记\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}When they get on target, and they will get on target...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.45,1:27:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后准备攻击\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}wait to engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.31,1:27:38.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙是群体攻击的\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Velociraptors are pack hunters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.49,1:27:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会把猎物赶到包围圈里\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They like to herd the animal into a kill zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.00,1:27:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到那时我们就开枪\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That's when we take our shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.54,1:27:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到我发出指令 给她最致命的一击\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Get a clear shot, wait on my command and give her everything you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.18,1:27:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目标只有一个 先生们\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We got one good target, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.35,1:27:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要误伤我的迅猛龙\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Do not shoot my Raptors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.25,1:27:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.36,1:27:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松 小蓝\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Easy, Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.22,1:27:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.04,1:28:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好女孩\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Attagirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.91,1:28:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓不到我\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You don't scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.72,1:28:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧文\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Owen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.83,1:28:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们安全吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are they safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.01,1:28:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们并不安全\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, they're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.24,1:28:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫什么名字?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What are their names?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.84,1:28:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是查理\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Well, you got Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.46,1:28:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的是艾可 这是德塔\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}There's Echo. Here is Delta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.23,1:28:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙叫小蓝 她是小头目\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}This one's called Blue. She's the Beta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.88,1:28:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大头目是谁?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Who's the alpha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.41,1:28:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在你眼前 小伙子\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You're looking at him, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.43,1:28:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.30,1:28:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常安全\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Totally safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.23,1:28:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 进去 快点\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}All right, get in. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.30,1:28:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.26,1:28:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想找我 我就在前面\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}If you need me, I'll be right up front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.35,1:28:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那窗户打开就行\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Just open that window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.07,1:28:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.35,1:28:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系上安全带\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Put your seatbelts on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.43,1:28:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 然后...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Okay, so just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.23,1:29:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手牵手\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}hold hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.64,1:29:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不会跑进来吧?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Nothing's getting in here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.77,1:29:26.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.07,1:29:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得那所老房子里的幽灵吗 在车库里那只?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Do you remember that ghost at the old house? Remember the one in the garage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.17,1:29:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有保护你 对吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I protected you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.13,1:29:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用尺和纸盘做了一个战斧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You made a battle axe out of a ruler and a paper plate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.07,1:29:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 所以只要有我在你就不会有事的 知道了吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah. See, nothing is gonna get you while I'm around, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.47,1:29:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不会永远在我身边\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}But you're not always gonna be around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.73,1:29:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 说得对...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Yeah, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.17,1:29:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.30,1:29:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟 好吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We're brothers, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.88,1:30:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都会是兄弟 永远都是彼此的坚强后盾\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}We'll always be brothers and we'll always come back to one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.86,1:30:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论发生什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.42,1:30:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论发生什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No matter what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.81,1:30:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论发生什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.77,1:30:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.17,1:30:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.09,1:32:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你男朋友真是个猛男\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Your boyfriend's a badass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.09,1:32:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下如果派它们去猎杀恐怖组织 你说该有多棒\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Imagine if we had these puppies in Tora Bora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.45,1:32:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你录下来了吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Are you recording this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.69,1:32:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们慢下来了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.05,1:32:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们察觉到了什么\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They got something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.99,1:32:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗? 这太血腥了 你们不能看这个\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}You know what? No, no, no. You guys are not gonna watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.81,1:33:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把窗户关上\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Keep the window closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.21,1:33:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情有点不大对劲\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.90,1:33:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在相互交流\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}They're communicating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.37,1:33:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总算知道他们为什么不肯说出这玩意的基因结构了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I know why they wouldn't tell us what it's made of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.69,1:33:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.32,1:34:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它有一部分迅猛龙的基因\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}That thing's part Raptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.25,1:34:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么还不行动? 开火!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}What's taking them so long? Light it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.79,1:34:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开火!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Engage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.43,1:34:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.32,1:34:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意六点钟方向\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Watch your six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.80,1:34:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙有新的大头目了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Raptors got a new alpha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.32,1:36:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}To the vehicles now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.83,1:36:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撤退!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.84,1:36:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.60,1:36:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝!\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Blue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.70,1:36:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.09,1:36:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有伤亡吗?\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Is everybody dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.26,1:36:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 无人伤亡\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}No, no, no. Everyone is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.13,1:36:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别撒谎了\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Don't lie to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.15,1:36:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很害怕 对害怕的人说谎没有关系\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}He's scared. It's okay to lie when people are scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.91,1:36:57.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想回家\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}I wanna go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.31,1:36:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你会回家的 好吗? 我保证\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Sweetheart, you will, okay? I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.49,1:37:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天你就能回家了...\N{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs14\fscy100\1c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H282828&\b0}Tomorrow you will be home...{\r}
